<title>USA: Hon Industries completes Allsteel deal.</title>
<headline>Hon Industries completes Allsteel deal.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hon Industries Inc said Wednesday it completed the acquisition of Allsteel Inc from BTR Plc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Allsteel, a maker of mid-priced office furniture, had sales of about $150 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Hon will add five manufacturing facilities with the acquisition of Allsteel, it said. Hon will continue to make and sell a separate line of Allsteel office furniture products.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
